{
  "tema": 7062,
  "slug": "hace-que-preterito",
  "titulo": "Hace + time + que + preterite: how long ago something happened",
  "subtitulo": "Hace dos horas que se fue: ago, at the start of the sentence.",
  "foto": "t01.jpg",
  "regla": "Hace + length of time + que + preterite = how long ago: hace dos días que pasó. A length of time, never a date, between hace and que.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To say **how long ago** something happened, use:"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**hace**",
            "length of time",
            "**que**",
            "preterite"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "This structure goes at the **beginning** of the sentence."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Between **hace** and **que** you need a **length of time** (un minuto, dos horas, seis meses, un año), never a specific date: **hace ayer que** ✗."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Another way: preterite + **hace** + time: **se fue hace dos horas** (see [[7063|hace for ago]])."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Compare: **hace … que** + present = it's still going; + preterite = it happened and finished."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **hace … que** + preterite is a stopwatch that already stopped."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "—¿Dónde está Beto? —==Hace== dos horas ==que se fue==.",
              "en": "\"Where's Beto?\" \"He left two hours ago.\""
            },
            {
              "es": "==Hace== dos días ==que pasó== el accidente.",
              "en": "The accident happened two days ago."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Hace== diez años ==que terminé== la escuela.",
              "en": "I finished school ten years ago."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Hace== un mes ==que compré== la tabla.",
              "en": "I bought the board a month ago."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Hace== mucho ==que no te vi== tan feliz.",
              "en": "It's been a long time since I saw you this happy."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Hace ayer que fuimos al cine."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Ayer fuimos al cine."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "No dates between **hace** and **que**."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Se fue hace dos horas que."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Hace dos horas que se fue."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "**Hace … que** goes first."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
